# todo.zd — the canonical UI benchmark, in ZDeceptron.
#
# ⚠️ ASPIRATIONAL. Unlike the other examples, this one uses syntax the
# language does not yet define. Writing it is what revealed the gaps:
#
#   1. `Todo` cannot be declared — there is no record/type syntax yet.
#   2. `add` is overloaded: numeric increment vs list append.
#      `subtract todo from todos` for removal is worse.
#   3. `set todos at todo.id . done to ...` parses but is unreadable.
#   4. Two-way binding on Input/Checkbox is implied but unspecified.
#
# Kept in the repository deliberately: it documents the target and the
# open questions. It will be updated as those are resolved.
#
# Note what is absent, and what the language already gets right: no store
# setup, no reducer, no API route, no database schema, no migration, no
# useEffect, no dependency array. The list is `durable`, so it persists
# and syncs. That is the whole configuration.

state todos    is durable List of Todo starting empty
state draft    is client  Text         starting ""
state showDone is client  Truth        starting yes

# Derived state. Recomputed when `todos` or `showDone` changes, and never
# otherwise — the signal graph knows the dependencies, so there is nothing
# to declare and nothing to keep in sync.
state visible is server List of Todo from filterTodos with todos, showDone

function filterTodos with all, includeDone
    from all
    keep each todo where includeDone or not todo.done
    sort each todo by todo.createdAt

view
    Column
        Heading "Todos"

        Row
            Input draft, hint is "what needs doing"
            Button "add"
                on click
                    add draft to todos
                    set draft to ""

        Row
            Checkbox showDone, label is "show completed"

        # `todos` is durable, so `visible` is server-derived, so reading
        # it here yields Remote of List of Todo. The loading and failure
        # states are not optional.
        when visible
            Loading           show Spinner
            Failed with error show ErrorBar message is error.message
            Ready with list
                each todo in list
                    Row todo.title, padding is 8
                        Checkbox todo.done
                            on change
                                set todos at todo.id . done to not todo.done
                        Button "delete"
                            on click
                                subtract todo from todos
